{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03159",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 4.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.8,
      "end_seconds": 10.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Morning, you know, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.88,
      "end_seconds": 12.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.29,
      "end_seconds": 22.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Mainly wheeze at work. There's a couple of other things, um, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 25.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.65,
      "end_seconds": 31.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "It's been three weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.04,
      "end_seconds": 37.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.68,
      "end_seconds": 52.59,
      "duration_seconds": 13.91,
      "text": "It's a couple of times a week. Weekends away helps a bit. Oh, and a cough that eases on holiday. That's been about the same, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.24,
      "end_seconds": 56.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.49,
      "end_seconds": 59.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "It comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.89,
      "end_seconds": 63.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Sure. And what about weight loss or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.11,
      "end_seconds": 69.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "No weight loss or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.64,
      "end_seconds": 77.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any coughing up blood or ankle swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.07,
      "end_seconds": 86.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "No, you know, no coughing up blood or ankle swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.63,
      "end_seconds": 90.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.29,
      "end_seconds": 93.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.89,
      "end_seconds": 98.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Okay, any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.89,
      "end_seconds": 104.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I mean, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.79,
      "end_seconds": 111.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Alright, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.86,
      "end_seconds": 123.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I live with my elderly mother. I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.3,
      "end_seconds": 128.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.47,
      "end_seconds": 138.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain. A reliever inhaler, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.1,
      "end_seconds": 142.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.89,
      "end_seconds": 144.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "100 micrograms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.26,
      "end_seconds": 168.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.09,
      "end_seconds": 172.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Yes, arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.47,
      "end_seconds": 176.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.18,
      "end_seconds": 182.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Um, um, no, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 184.54,
      "end_seconds": 193.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse 81, respiratory rate 15. Blood pressure 122 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.98,
      "end_seconds": 194.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.95,
      "end_seconds": 200.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.22,
      "end_seconds": 213.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.15,
      "end_seconds": 216.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.63,
      "end_seconds": 230.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "There is a little wheeze at the end of each breath out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.19,
      "end_seconds": 236.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.37,
      "end_seconds": 254.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably occupational asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.62,
      "end_seconds": 265.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange spirometry for wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.75,
      "end_seconds": 268.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.8,
      "end_seconds": 291.75,
      "duration_seconds": 19.95,
      "text": "I'm sending you for serial peak flow readings because of work-related wheeze. I'll start you on beclometasone inhaler, 200 micrograms, twice a day, long term. That should help with asthma. Record peak flows at work and at home for four weeks. I'll also refer you to occupational health."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.21,
      "end_seconds": 293.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.92,
      "end_seconds": 307.33,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's review you in four weeks. Alright, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.71,
      "end_seconds": 311.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.3,
      "end_seconds": 313.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}